#: ../../general_concepts/colors/color_models.rst:186
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"b\\* in this case is a measurement of how yellow a color is versus how blue "
"a color is."
msgstr ""
"b\\* je v tem primeru meritev, kako rumena je barva v primerjavi s tem, kako "
